("Which Linux is best for an old laptop?", "Lightweight systems such as Linux Mint Xfce, Lubuntu and Debian with LXDE or LXQt are built to run well on older hardware."),
("What does LTS mean?", "LTS stands for long term support. An LTS release receives updates for several years, so it suits people who want stability."),
